+    """Where Winds Meet / Messiah Engine creates worker threads matching logical CPU count.
+    On multi-threaded CPUs (e.g. 8c/16t Ryzen 9800X3D), spawning 13+ concurrent worker threads
+    oversaturates physical cores and causes high involuntary preemption and long loading stalls.
+    Clamping CPU topology to physical cores (no SMT) reduces workers to 6 and matches P10-34.
+    """
+    util.set_cpu_topology_nosmt(core_limit=8)
